  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You can channel a connection another creature’s ether to pull it away from them to take it as your own. You learn the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.feats.Item.EI6tbxtfyMoiIGov]{Drain Ether} innate cantrip. As it is a cantrip, its spell level is automatically heightened to equal to half your level rounded up. You choose the spellcasting tradition of this cantrip, and it uses the higher of your spell DC or class DC. When you acquire this feature, choose which saving throw the cantrip will use. You can retrain this feat to change the saving throw after a week of downtime.</span></p>"
